        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/t/58956e/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2011-08-23T14:40:55.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I am planning to do some demos in my local store to drum up interest and was wondering what people think about what would work best.</p>\n<p>I was planning on doing Baron Blade with a random environment and letting players choose their Hero.</p>\n<p>Also in a 2 player game I was thinking of reducing the HP of the villain by Half to give the players a chance at defeating them.</p>\n<p>Any thoughts?</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:34:41.697Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
