        "raw": "[quote=\"\"Christopher\"\"]\n\nI was just reading through the FallCon (an awesome con in Canada) blog, and ran across these pages.  Thought they might help!\n\n[url=http://www.fallcon.com/_blog/FallCon_Blog/post/How_to_Teach_Games_An_Introduction_(Part_1)/]http://www.fallcon.com/_blog/FallCon_Blog/post/How_to_Teach_Games_An_Introduction_(Part_1)/[/url]\n\n[url=http://www.fallcon.com/_blog/FallCon_Blog/post/How_to_Teach_Games_General_Tips_(Part_2)/]http://www.fallcon.com/_blog/FallCon_Blog/post/How_to_Teach_Games_General_Tips_(Part_2)/[/url]\n\n[url=http://www.fallcon.com/_blog/FallCon_Blog/post/How_to_Teach_Games_The_Framework_(Part_3)/]http://www.fallcon.com/_blog/FallCon_Blog/post/How_to_Teach_Games_The_Framework_(Part_3)/[/url]\n\n[/quote]\n\n\nThanks, those links are a good resource. As a veteran demo representative they were enlightening. I am still looking for SotM specific demo ideas though.",
